  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13788</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ねぇ〜、カル様ぁ〜∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heeey~ Master Chal? ∀</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14156</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>カ、カル様!?
やめんか、気持ち悪い！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>M-Master Chal?! Do not call me that, it's incredibly uncomfortable!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、カル様って皇帝陛下と
婚約する予定なんだよねぇ？
つまり未来の超〜エライ人……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, Master Chal intends on marrying the impress right? That'd make you worthy of a title, no?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうか……！
コネとしては最高よね♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She's right, you know! It's such an honor to be your acquaintance! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ〜ん、カル様と
お近づきになりた〜い∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh, how I wish I could get to know you better! ∀</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……パライバ様との婚約は
父上が政略として勝手に
進めた事なのだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...My engagement to Her Majesty was something my father put into place in order to gain political power.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だが、教会が壊滅した今は
それも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But now that the church has been demolished...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16240</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>けどさ、カルセドニー……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Y'know, Chalcedony...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16332</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でもさ、カルセドニー……
・これから告白しに行くんでしょ？
・ふたりはラブラブなんでしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Y'know, Chalcedony...
・Aren't you now free to go propose yourself?
・You're both crazy in love, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16472</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これから告白しに行くんでしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aren't you now free to go propose yourself?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16800</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こ、告白などと……
今はそんな時ではないだろう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>P-Propose...?! Now is hardly the time!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17320</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あら、愛を伝えるのに
こんな時も
そんな時もないでしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's no such thing as a right or wrong time to tell someone you love them, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17500</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぐふふ〜〜〜
言っちゃいなよぉ、カル様ぁ∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hehehe~ by the way, Master Chal...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ついでに、ボクを
ぜひ宮廷画家にすべき逸材だって
推薦して欲しいなぁ〜♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Put in a good word for me, would you? A great artist such as myself would be honored to become your personal court painter~! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18664</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>カル様〜〜〜！
宮廷御用たしの運び屋として
私の推薦もお願いしま〜す∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, Master Chal~? Please recommend me for the imperial court's dedicated courier! ∀</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19060</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……わかった。パライバ様には
『最高にずうずうしい奴ら』として
お前たちを推薦しておこう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Understood. I shall personally recommend you both to her majesty as “the most brazen individuals”.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……わかった。パライバ様には
『最高にずうずうしい奴ら』として
お前たちを推薦しておこう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Understood. I shall personally recommend you both to her majesty as “the most brazen individuals”.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふたりはラブラブなんでしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're both crazy in love, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>20216</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……僕には、今のパライバ様の
気持ちはわからない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...To tell the truth, I do not know how her majesty feels right now...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>21028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>当然よ！
他人のスピリアを全部理解できる
人なんていやしないわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Of course you don't! No one can ever truly understand another's Spiria.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>21192</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>大切なのは感じる事……
若いうちから頭だけで
ウジウジ考えちゃダメよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But what matters is how you FEEL... following your heart's what being young is all about, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>21600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……うんうん。
あんまり若くない人の忠告は
聞いた方がいいよぉ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mhm, mhm! Take it from someone who was once young herself!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>22180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……あら！　&lt;Beryl&gt;が
私を挑発するスピリアは
全部理解できちゃったわ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...My, I take it back! I I can read YOUR Spiria like an open book! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>22496</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いてててて〜〜〜！
つねられすぎて、ボクの
若い肌が伸びちゃうぅ〜〜〜っ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Owowow~! Quit pinching me, my soft baby skin's gonna get all stretched out~!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>23240</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……なるほどな。
&lt;Shing&gt;がノーテンキな
理由がわかった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I see. I understand why &lt;Shing&gt; is as happy-go-lucky as he is now.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>23568</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こんな仲間が一緒では
ひとりで悩んでいるのが
バカらしくなるはずだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>With friends like these at your side, worrying alone must feel rather foolish.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
